      "get": {
        "description": "the competitor set is derived from keyword overlap in the chosen `source` database, so a domain's competitors differ per country.\n\n> **Request example pending verification.** The request example for this endpoint has not yet been verified in production. Static examples describe the request format; replace sample values with your own. Check the estimated price with a free quote request (`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`) before running it.",
