    "/apis/v1/seranking/google-keywords-ideas": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Three sibling endpoints share this exact parameter shape and price and differ only in how\nthey pick the ideas: /v1/keywords/related (semantically related, this entry),\n/v1/keywords/similar (same-SERP overlap) and /v1/keywords/questions (question phrasings).\n/v1/keywords/longtail returns bare strings\nwith no metrics.\n\n> **Request example pending verification.** The request example for this endpoint has not yet been verified in production. Static examples describe the request format; replace sample values with your own. Check the estimated price with a free quote request (`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`) before running it.",
